Five MPS/MLX compatibility fixes for sglang upstream main (tested @ 73d0989d9):
pool stats observer + invariant checker mamba guards, pin_memory CUDA-only
guards, strict videos_kwargs filtering, CPU device fallback for the fast
image processor. Apply from repo root: git apply benchmark/marlin_video/patches/sglang_main_mps_mlx_fixes.patch

diff --git a/python/sglang/srt/managers/scheduler_components/invariant_checker.py b/python/sglang/srt/managers/scheduler_components/invariant_checker.py
